{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration Your Way</strong>: Choose between Stealth, Weapons, Defense, or Diplomacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully Interactive Universe</strong>: Travel without loading screens across a procedurally generated universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adaptive Research System</strong>: Unlock ship upgrades by salvaging/trading alien tech or discovering scientific phenomena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What\u2019s Different:</strong> Most space games simulate a scaled-down or segmented universe. In <i>No End</i>, the universe is <strong>completely seamless and 1:1 in scale</strong>\u2014no loading screens, and the celestial distances are realistically vast.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823140?t=1750299917","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823140/6032e9d95476fc4f99de71c5f20d4667ca9715f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750299917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823140/217110619d3a2caaab1bcb834739962802a062cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750299917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823140/217110619d3a2caaab1bcb834739962802a062cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750299917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_par